# Studio scratch: per-frame segments, page builds, stills and intermediate audio (regenerated by any run)
*/out/**/work/
*/out/audio/*.wav
*/out/narration/.takes/
*/out/compare/engine-a/explainer-*
*/out/**/*.m4a
*/out/compare/engine-a/
*/out/**/text-inspection.json
*/out/narration/*.wav
# run caches: committing them would make another machine skip narration/render while the audio is not in git
*/out/run-state.json
*/out/narration/narration-hash.txt
# Scheduled production (portfolio-production.yml) runs `git add channels`: a premium shadow render of a live run
# (IB_PREMIUM_RENDER=preview) must stay on the runner and is reviewed from the job artifact. Evidence committed on
# purpose lives in docs/premium-studio/evidence/impossible-brief/ (tracked files here would be rewritten by a shadow run
# and committed by production even with this rule).
/*/
